'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Locations|location]] found northwest in [[Highlands]], hidden under the mountain. Many stones block the enterance at first and must be removed with a pickaxe. The cavern is similar to [[Stardew:Quarry Mine|Quarry Mine]] as it is just one large floor as opposed to multiple decending floors. 

The cavern is filled with dangerous monsters but also has many foragables and an exclusive fishing area. 

