==Fish==
[[File:Fish Zone Highlands Cavern.png|thumb|Fishing zone from land for the Crystal Cavern]]
The fishing area is located in the northwest corner of the cavern, and casting can prove difficult, similar to the [[Crimson Badlands]], as enemies continue to attack while fishing. 

However, there is a secret passage to a small outcropping that allows for fishing while being protected, except for Bats. This is also where mystic stones can possibly be found. 

There is one exlcusive fish to this area: [[Gemfish]] which can be very valuable for selling, gifting, and even in a fish pond. 
